WEBVTT

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:31.440
I think that will be big.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:35.250
But more importantly as Shah Rukh
mentioned, with Artificial Intelligence,

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:40.040
I think for our grand children,
we can solve many more difficult problems.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:43.270
We can cure diseases 
which are tough to cure today.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.560
We can tackle problems 
like pollution and climate change.

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:50.840
And so I think, we are working on AI,
to really make a difference.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:54.840
For me when I think about India,
I think for our grand children,

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:57.570
any Indian will be able to speak 
to any another Indian

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:59.220
regardless of language.

00:14:59.220 --> 00:15:02.640
You will be able to speak,
and the other person to understand.